  "definition": "Leachfield Repair Residuals Landfills",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-12-21",
  "historyNote": "#6619-B, eff 10-29-97; amd by #6894-B, eff 12-1-98; ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2510.05); ss by #10597, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14156, eff 12-21-24",
